      "name": "t:sections.custom-html.presets.custom-html.name",
      "settings": {
        "title": "",
        "custom_html": "<div class=\"page-width\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/icon-Seasonal-Catalog.png?v=1687980034\" alt=\"Seasonal Catalog icon\" float=\"left\">\n\n<strong>Learn about our business</strong> - Russo Power has grown a lot over the last decade, and as we continue to expand, you can hear about all of our exciting new developments!<p></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/icon-Event_Calendar.png?v=1687980034\" alt=\"Event Calendar icon\">\n\n<strong>Find out about upcoming events</strong> - Learn about events like open houses, live auctions, seminars, demos, and more that we host throughout the year.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/icon-New.png?v=1687980035\" alt=\"New icon\">\n\n<strong>Discover the latest products</strong> - At our stores, we only carry brands that are trusted &amp; proven by landscape professionals like you. Don't miss out when products hit our shelves!</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/icon-Russo_Resources.png?v=1687980034\" alt=\"Russo Resources icon\">\n\n<strong>New technology news</strong> - The brands we carry constantly release innovative equipment that is more efficient &amp; productive than ever, so don't miss out on the latest advancements!</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/icon-Demos_Rentals_Leases.png?v=1687980035\" alt=\"Demos Rentals and Leases icon\">\n\n<strong>Useful recommendations</strong> - Our knowledgeable employees love providing tips &amp; tricks that will make your life easier and your crew more productive than ever!</p>\n</div>"
